But then when you're in when you're in this actual like action sequence like that is just

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.660
these are your calories like you can burn them.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:13.860
But like if you stop that, they kind of they'll refill back to where they were pretty quickly.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:18.940
But if you get hit, if you take damage in any way that that brings your total down.

