But at the same time, it all comes with a trade off.

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:30.100
Like, I think that's what I appreciate so much about the design of this game is, yeah,

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:34.400
everything everything has a counterbalance to it as well.

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.120
So you can you can take your time.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.900
The game is never forcing you to move very fast, except for after you've blown up the

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:40.960
core, rightfully so.

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:45.400
But you can take your time with the game, but you can also be rewarded for moving quickly.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:49.960
You know, to weigh in on the whole energy thing, I feel like that's something that we've seen

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:55.160
in other games that I usually don't like, where like your energy is constantly expending or

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:56.440
a lot of times it is a timer.

