But the reason for me that it that it works here and it doesn't in other games is that

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:09.980
it can't just run out and then you die.

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:15.220
So it doesn't feel like you're like you're fighting against this this clock or this like

00:23:15.220 --> 00:23:16.500
a typical timer.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:22.580
Yeah. What you know, even if you get really low, that just means now you have much less health.

